kpm (Kubernetes Pods Metrics) is a configuration-first CLI that samples
pod CPU/memory from the Metrics API into local SQLite and surfaces
rightsizing workflows. It is read-only toward the cluster and uses
client-go (no kubectl subprocess for metrics).

This package installs the static binary, the kubectl-kpm plugin shim, man
pages, license text, and a sample config under share/examples/kpm/.

WWW: https://github.com/hrodrig/kpm
